# talkrypt release public key (ML-DSA-87) — SECURITY-AUDIT F-8.
#
# This is the TRUST ANCHOR for release-artifact signatures. The maintainer runs
# `talkrypt-relsign keygen` ONCE, keeps the SEED offline / in the CI secret
# TALKRYPT_RELEASE_SK, and commits the PUBKEY hex below (on the line after this
# comment block, whitespace-only otherwise). Verifiers pin THIS repo copy — never
# the copy bundled in a downloaded release (a MITM could swap both).
#
# Until a real release key is published, this file is an unfilled placeholder and
# signature verification is advisory (verify.sh reports it as not-checked).
